1
00:00:00,999 --> 00:00:04,209
(Raj:)- You told her?
- l told everybody.

2
00:00:06,004 --> 00:00:08,964
(Bernadette:)We believe there's someone out there
who'll love you for you.

3
00:00:09,174 --> 00:00:11,594
(Howard:)We kind of agreed to disagree
on that one.

4
00:00:11,801 --> 00:00:15,011
(Howard:)But we both think
you shouldn't marry this woman.

5
00:00:15,222 --> 00:00:17,892
(Raj:)So while I'm waiting
for this mysterious perfect match...

6
00:00:18,099 --> 00:00:21,349
(Raj:)...who may or may not exist,
I'm supposed to just be alone?

7
00:00:21,561 --> 00:00:23,021
(Bernadette:)Not necessarily.

8
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:27,570
l think we found someone for you
to cuddle with.

9
00:00:29,027 --> 00:00:30,607
(Raj:)Oh, my goodness.

10
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:34,620
(Raj:)Aren't you the cutest little Yorkie ever?

11
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,410
(Raj:)- You got him for me?
- Her.

12
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:41,210
(Howard:)We thought you two would hit it off.

13
00:00:41,414 --> 00:00:44,914
l think we already have.
Thank you guys so much.

14
00:00:45,126 --> 00:00:48,296
Let's go see if you fit in my man-purse.

15
00:00:50,674 --> 00:00:53,924
(Bernadette:)Metrosexual, my ass.

